ntermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI, KAZUHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI KAZUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI, KAZUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An image forming device, wherein, even when a main body upper part (100) is open to the maximum, a part (102a) of its side wall (bottom wall of a recessed part (102)) is overlapped with a manual paper feed tray (18), whereby, even if there is a slight variation in assembly of the manual paper feed tray, the manual paper feed tray is not damaged when the main body upper part is opened and closed.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se rapporte à un dispositif de formation d'image dans lequel, même lorsqu'une partie supérieure (100) du corps principal est ouverte au maximum, une partie (102a) de sa paroi latérale (paroi inférieure d'une partie évidée (102)) est recouverte par un plateau d'alimentation en papier manuelle (18). Ainsi, même s'il y a un léger écart d'alignement lors du montage du plateau d'alimentation en papier manuelle, celui-ci n'est pas endommagé lorsque la partie supérieure du corps principal est ouverte et fermée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>